  "question": {
    "text": "A cylinder with fixed capacity of <math><mn>67.2</mn></math> litre contains helium gas at STP. The amount of heat needed to raise the temperature of the gas by <math><mn>20</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is:<br />[Given that <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8.31</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math>"
